SoftEther VPN protocol compatibility
------------------------------------
secon is an independent, compatible implementation of the SoftEther VPN client
protocol. It does not contain source code from SoftEther VPN. The protocol was
implemented by studying the SoftEther VPN source code
(https://github.com/SoftEtherVPN/SoftEtherVPN, Apache License 2.0);
docs/PROTOCOL.md summarizes that protocol and cites the relevant source files.

secon is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the SoftEther VPN
Project, SoftEther Corporation, or the University of Tsukuba.
"SoftEther" is used only to describe protocol compatibility.

